    "description": "SLID launches Public Sector Forum to advance governance excellence in State-Owned Enterprises",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/SLID-launches-Public-Sector-Forum-to-advance-governance-excellence-in-State-Owned-Enterprises/34-793378",
