    "chunk_text": "It\u2019s said that CIC and Singer (Sri Lanka) performed well. Banking sector counters, especially Commercial Bank, performed well, while the manufacturing sector, especially JKH, also did well at the floor.\n\nYesterday, the rupee was quoted at Rs 333.00/334.00 to the US dollar in the spot market, from Rs 333.00/334.50 the previous day.\n\nThe telegraphic transfer rate for Sri Lanka\u2019s rupee against the US dollar was 329.00 buying, 338.00 selling; the euro was 378.7135 selling, 392.6305 buying; and the pound was 439.9314 buying, 453.9770 selling.\n\nAn auction of Rs 701 billion s treasury bills was scheduled for today.\n\nDFCC Bank expands everyday benefits for senior citizens through DFCC Garusaru\n\nSun Siyam & Studio Sixty7 win two international property awards Asia Pacific for design excellence across Sri Lanka and the Maldives\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
