    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s uneven growth: Why Colombo thrives while the rest of the country struggles",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Sri-Lanka-s-uneven-growth-Why-Colombo-thrives-while-the-rest-of-the-country-struggles/14-793391",
    "lang": "en",
