    "description": "The AI decision Sri Lankan schools are taking in silence",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/The-AI-decision-Sri-Lankan-schools-are-taking-in-silence/4-793397",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
