    "description": "Open letter from Rosy Senanayake to the Government of Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Open-letter-from-Rosy-Senanayake-to-the-Government-of-Sri-Lanka/108-343126",
    "lang": "en",
