    "chunk_size_bytes": 705,
    "chunk_text": "When you\u2019re that rich, you can speak that low...\u201d Trump jokes with UAE president\n\nJune 17 (Daily Mirror) - US President Donald Trump shared a light-hearted moment with UAE President Sheikh Mohammed bin Zayed Al Nahyan during the G7 Summit in France, drawing laughter with remarks about the Emirati leader's soft-spoken style.\n\nAfter Sheikh Mohammed addressed the gathering in a calm tone, Trump quipped: \"When you're that rich, you can speak that low.\"\n\nAs those present laughed, the US president continued: \"I was just wondering, can anybody hear that?\"\n\nTrump then elaborated on the joke, saying: \"But when you're so rich, you have such confidence that you don't have to do any strain to the voice.\""
